<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>DBeaver on askama00</title><link>https://askama00.github.io/tags/dbeaver/</link><description>Recent content in DBeaver on askama00</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 20 Oct 2023 11:31:19 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://askama00.github.io/tags/dbeaver/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>DBeaver更换驱动Maven源</title><link>https://askama00.github.io/posts/dbeaver-maven-source/</link><pubDate>Fri, 20 Oct 2023 11:31:19 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://askama00.github.io/posts/dbeaver-maven-source/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="dbeaver更换驱动maven源"&gt;DBeaver更换驱动Maven源&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;1、打开 DBeaver 点击【窗口】-&amp;gt;【首选项】&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://askama00.github.io/img/posts/dbeaver-maven-source/img01.png" alt=""&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;2、点击【连接】-&amp;gt;【驱动】-&amp;gt;【Maven】&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://askama00.github.io/img/posts/dbeaver-maven-source/img02.png" alt=""&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;3、点击右侧的【添加】，粘贴&lt;strong&gt;阿里云镜像&lt;/strong&gt;地址：http://maven.aliyun.com/nexus/content/groups/public/&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://askama00.github.io/img/posts/dbeaver-maven-source/img03.png" alt=""&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;4、点击【确定】完成添加，之后在仓库地址表格的下面选中我们刚加入的阿里云镜像地址，点击右侧的【向上】将阿里镜像移动到最上面，点击最下面的【应用并关闭】，完成。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://askama00.github.io/img/posts/dbeaver-maven-source/img04.png" alt=""&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;本文原发表于 &lt;a href="https://blog.csdn.net/qq_43306261/article/details/133942559"&gt;CSDN&lt;/a&gt;，同步于本站。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/blockquote&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>